  name: "layered silk mantle",
  short: "layered silk mantle",
  long: "This mantle is cut from layered silk and hangs from the shoulders to"
        "the small of the back, heavier at the hem so it does not lift in a"
        "wind. The shoulders are quilted over a thin wool lining, and it"
        "fastens at the collarbone with a plain silver clasp. It moves"
        "quietly, and it turns a glancing blow better than its weight would"
        "suggest.",
